{"id":"abe5105dc83b1e79","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-metric-on-terms.md","title":"项树的首差度量","display":"df-metric-on-terms — 项树的首差度量","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-infinite-term]]"],"label":"56-df-metric-on-terms","aliases":["56-df-metric-on-terms"],"display":"df-metric-on-terms — 项树的首差度量","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §12.2, printed pp670–671","source_ocr_block":"691–692","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-metric-on-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-metric-on-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metric-on-terms — 项树的首差度量"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §12.2, printed pp670–671"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"691–692"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a>。取不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cup\\mathcal V\">\\(F\\cup\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中的符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T^\\infty\">\\(s,t\\in T^\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|p|\">\\(|p|\\)</span> 是有限位置串长度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat t\">\\(\\widehat t\\)</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 补全树外位置后的全函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat t(p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&amp;p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\\\\\bot&amp;p\\notin\\mathrm{dom}(t).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat t(p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&amp;p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\\\\\bot&amp;p\\notin\\mathrm{dom}(t).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{|p|:p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega},\\widehat s(p)\\ne\\widehat t(p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{|p|:p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega},\\widehat s(p)\\ne\\widehat t(p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;s=t,\\\\2^{-\\min\\Delta(s,t)}&amp;s\\ne t.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;s=t,\\\\2^{-\\min\\Delta(s,t)}&amp;s\\ne t.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.2（印刷 pp670–671，OCR 页块691–692）。不同的树必在某个有限位置首次有别，故非等分支的最小值存在。根不同距离为 1；共同前缀越深距离越小。旧文未解释的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s|_k\">\\(s|_k\\)</span> 与自然语言分支已经替换为明确的全标签函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-infinite-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，见 [[56-df-infinite-term]]。取不在 $F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 中的符号 $\\bot$。$s,t\\in T^\\infty$；$|p|$ 是有限位置串长度。$\\widehat t$ 为以 $\\bot$ 补全树外位置后的全函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\cup\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"|p|","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat t","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat t(p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),\\\\\\bot&p\\notin\\mathrm{dom}(t).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta(s,t)\\coloneqq\\{|p|:p\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega},\\widehat s(p)\\ne\\widehat t(p)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d(s,t)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&s=t,\\\\2^{-\\min\\Delta(s,t)}&s\\ne t.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"s|_k","display":false}],"bytes":1329,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-metric-on-terms.md]]"},{"id":"4c072e6a1aee9fc9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$d$ 为 [[56-df-metric-on-terms]] 中首差度量；$T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 中全部有限项树的集合。变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 非空。$\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}$，每个序列分量仅在自然数下标处使用；$\\varepsilon$ 遍历正实数。"}],"outgoing":["ef3a31528875d9d3"]}